  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>Como cada primer domingo de mes se ha celebrado hoy Suera Obert Museu (SOM), organizado por el Centre Cultural Suera, y que ha tenido como punto principal la visita a la iglesia parroquial.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/03/IMG_0153.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Despu&eacute;s han visitado el templo por el exterior y han llegado hasta la calle del Portell, donde hab&iacute;a colgadas una colcha y otros ornamentos. Despu&eacute;s han visitado un molino antiguo, una muestra de cer&aacute;mica, y el recorrido guiado ha finalizado, como siempre, en el Ayuntamiento.</p>\n<p>El SOM se ha completado, como cada mes, con el mercado de Comerciants de Sueras<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none\">&nbsp;</span> en la plaza Mayor y cuenta con la colaboraci&oacute;n del Ayuntamiento.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0150.jpg\" alt=\"img_0150\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0151.jpg\" alt=\"img_0151\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0152.jpg\" alt=\"img_0152\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0153.jpg\" alt=\"img_0153\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0154.jpg\" alt=\"img_0154\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0155.jpg\" alt=\"img_0155\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0156.jpg\" alt=\"img_0156\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0157.jpg\" alt=\"img_0157\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0158.jpg\" alt=\"img_0158\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0159.jpg\" alt=\"img_0159\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0160.jpg\" alt=\"img_0160\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0161.jpg\" alt=\"img_0161\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0162.jpg\" alt=\"img_0162\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0163.jpg\" alt=\"img_0163\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0164.jpg\" alt=\"img_0164\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0165.jpg\" alt=\"img_0165\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0166.jpg\" alt=\"img_0166\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0167.jpg\" alt=\"img_0167\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0168.jpg\" alt=\"img_0168\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0169.jpg\" alt=\"img_0169\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sommarc2012/img_0